鳥…","nextNodeIds":[210350102,210350103]},{"nodeId":210350102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2407296074,"text":"孫宇？","nextNodeIds":[210350104]},{"nodeId":210350104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":764380746,"text":"旅人？奇遇だな、まさかこんなところで会えるとは…","nextNodeIds":[210350105]},{"nodeId":210350105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":1183406746,"text":"私は…ここで鍛錬をしている。少し経ったら璃月を出て、外を旅するつもりだ。","nextNodeIds":[210350106,210350107]},{"nodeId":210350106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":723559842,"text":"どうして急に璃月を出るの？","nextNodeIds":[210350108]},{"nodeId":210350108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":2044285938,"text":"コホン…恥ずかしい話だが、確かに私は古華派を復興するといつも言っているが、普段していることといえば…仙人を訪ねると言って、その実は絶雲の間をぶらついているに過ぎないんだ…","nextNodeIds":[210350109]},{"nodeId":210350109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":1919040562,"text":"小鳥がいつもそばにいてくれることには感謝している。だが、私のしていることが、古華派を復興するのに何の役にも立たないことも分かっている…","nextNodeIds":[210350110]},{"nodeId":210350110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":417847346,"text":"この間、買い物に街に行った時、あるフォンテーヌから来た商人と話をしたんだが…","nextNodeIds":[210350111]},{"nodeId":210350111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":219405346,"text":"彼に「解決策を、問題が生じた場所で見出すことはできない」と言われた。","nextNodeIds":[210350112]},{"nodeId":210350112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":2172401650,"text":"私は長い間考えたが…もしかしたら、このフォンテーヌの商人は、璃月以外のところに旅に出ようと提案してくれたのかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[210350113,210350114]},{"nodeId":210350113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":720649154,"text":"外を見に行くのもいいことだ。","nextNodeIds":[210350115]},{"nodeId":210350115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":1518315962,"text":"私もそう思っているが…小鳥はどうしても璃月を離れたくないようなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[210350116]},{"nodeId":210350116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":1421013562,"text":"普段の小鳥は拗ねているように見えて、あれが本気でないことは分かっている。ただ彼女をなだめて、機嫌を直してやればいいんだ。","nextNodeIds":[210350117]},{"nodeId":210350117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":4037154538,"text":"でも今回、小鳥は本当に怒っているようだ。どうしても私の言うことを聞かず、一人で街まで行ってしまった。はぁ…","nextNodeIds":[210350118]},{"nodeId":210350118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":485891178,"text":"その話はやめよう、こんなくだらない話、君も聞きたくはないだろう…旅人、一つお願いしてもいいか？","nextNodeIds":[210350119]},{"nodeId":210350119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":1255235810,"text":"身を守るための武術に多少の心得はあるが、普段は本気でやりあったことがあまりないんだ。これからは旅に出るんだから、実戦は避けられないはずだ…","nextNodeIds":[210350120]},{"nodeId":210350120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":3771415234,"text":"旅人、君の外での冒険談をたくさん聞いたよ。君なら、魔物に対応する方法はたくさん知っているだろう。","nextNodeIds":[210350121]},{"nodeId":210350121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":4068883586,"text":"練習相手となる魔物を探しに行くのに付き合ってくれないか？ついでに、指導もお願いできるとありがたい。","nextNodeIds":[210350122,210350123]},{"nodeId":210350122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3792430458,"text":"問題ない。","nextNodeIds":[210350125]},{"nodeId":210350125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":438068418,"text":"そうだな…ちょうどこの近くに魔物の集落が一つある。まずはそこに行こう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":210350123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1624485930,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}の動きを目で追うので精一杯かも。","nextNodeIds":[210350124]},{"nodeId":210350124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"孫宇","textMapHash":3924079418,"text":"おっと…君、そんなに腕が立つのか？ハハハ、それなら少しゆっくり動いてもらわないとな。","nextNodeIds":[210350125]},{"nodeId":210350114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3673542106,"text":"気晴らしだと思えばいい。","nextNodeIds":[210350115]},{"nodeId":210350107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1922361322,"text":"古華派を復興するんじゃないの？","nextNodeIds":[210350108]},{"nodeId":210350103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3263613482,"text":"何をしてるの？","nextNodeIds":[210350104]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2103501,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["2400"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2103502,"order":2,"stepDescription":"すべての魔物を倒す","stepDescTextMapHash":950960540,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q2103501"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q2103503","30"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q2103501"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133106034","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNRE